      "text": "• репозиторий: cmd/{api, relay, balance-worker,\n   activity-worker, notification-worker, janitor,\n   dlq-replay}, internal/…\n• Docker Compose: Postgres, Redis, Kafka (KRaft),\n   MinIO\n• миграции golang-migrate (000001_init)\n• конфиг через env, Makefile, golangci-lint, CI",
