      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "• outbox в одной транзакции с записью\n• Outbox Relay: poll, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED,\n   key = group_id, retry с backoff\n• Balance worker: inbox (processed_events),\n   ExpenseDeleted → откат долей\n• Activity worker: таблица activity,\n   лента в GET /groups/{id} (keyset)",
      "originalText": "• outbox в одной транзакции с записью\n• Outbox Relay: poll, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED,\n   key = group_id, retry с backoff\n• Balance worker: inbox (processed_events),\n   ExpenseDeleted → откат долей\n• Activity worker: таблица activity,\n   лента в GET /groups/{id} (keyset)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
